":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":4044708114,"text":"今度はモンドに現れるなんて、どうして…","nextNodeIds":[706740102,706740103]},{"nodeId":706740102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1321104658,"text":"宏朗？","nextNodeIds":[706740104]},{"nodeId":706740104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2754312882,"text":"旅人！ここで会えるなんて、なんとも奇遇だね。","nextNodeIds":[706740105]},{"nodeId":706740105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2992605882,"text":"今の状況については…隣にあるこの扉を見れば、だいたい理解できるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[706740106,706740107]},{"nodeId":706740106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":334960586,"text":"前回みたいな秘境がまた現れた？","nextNodeIds":[706740108]},{"nodeId":706740108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3814674402,"text":"そう。前回の秘境は旅人が探索を手伝ってくれたおかげで、多くの貴重な資料を手に入れることができた。","nextNodeIds":[706740109]},{"nodeId":706740109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":564814210,"text":"ただ…協会も各所を調べてくれてはいるが、外部からはこれ以上有益な情報を得られないようでね。","nextNodeIds":[706740110]},{"nodeId":706740110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":1603979362,"text":"探索の人員を増やそうと他の協会にも協力を要請したけど、その矢先に秘境が消えてしまったんだ…","nextNodeIds":[706740111]},{"nodeId":706740111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3328403642,"text":"そして今日、こうしてモンドに突如現れたというわけさ…モンドの冒険者協会の仲間が知らせてくれてね、俺はすぐに駆けつけたよ。","nextNodeIds":[706740112]},{"nodeId":706740112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":202551458,"text":"もう探索は始まってるの？","nextNodeIds":[706740113]},{"nodeId":706740113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":990303378,"text":"もちろん。秘境が目の前にあるというのに、退く理由なんてどこにもないだろ？","nextNodeIds":[706740114]},{"nodeId":706740114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":1326549250,"text":"この秘境の「原理」は、そう変わっていない。以前と同じで、中に入った人の思いによってデザインされた何かが現れる。","nextNodeIds":[706740115]},{"nodeId":706740115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2835851986,"text":"ただ、探索中に発見したんだが…この秘境はなんと、「敵」を生み出すことができるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[706740116]},{"nodeId":706740116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":854752522,"text":"それらの「敵」はこちらを攻撃でき、攻撃された側もリアルな痛みを感じる。","nextNodeIds":[706740117]},{"nodeId":706740117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3466970530,"text":"なんというか…現実の「戦闘」とほぼ変わらなくてね。冒険者たちも、このことに強い興味を抱いてる。","nextNodeIds":[706740118]},{"nodeId":706740118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":1958852194,"text":"けど冒険者の中には、自分の思いによってデザインされた「敵」に勝てない人もいるようだ。そういった人は、他の人に助けてもらっているよ、まったく…","nextNodeIds":[706740119]},{"nodeId":706740119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":315575170,"text":"コホン！説明はここまでにして…旅人、もしよかったら、また俺らと一緒にこの秘境を探索してくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[706740120,706740122]},{"nodeId":706740120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1719189818,"text":"うん、分かった。","nextNodeIds":[706740121]},{"nodeId":706740121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3677906042,"text":"ハハハ、本当に良かった！お前の協力があれば、俺らの仕事も大いにはかどるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706740122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":247125722,"text":"危険な目に遭ったりしないかな…","nextNodeIds":[706740123]},{"nodeId":706740123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":2738815938,"text":"えっと…警戒さえ怠らなければ、お前の腕なら問題ないさ。","nextNodeIds":[706740124]},{"nodeId":706740124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","textMapHash":3589135394,"text":"とにかく、ぜひこの秘境の探索を手伝ってほしい。お前の協力があれば、俺らの仕事も大いにはかどるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706740107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3112788746,"text":"#{M#君}{F#あなた}が研究してるあのタイプの秘境？","nextNodeIds":[706740108]},{"nodeId":706740103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2492312586,"text":"これって…","nextNodeIds":[706740104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7067401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30153"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7067401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30153,"speakerName":"宏朗","count":17},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[170674],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":663224662,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"30153":[1230]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":706740101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","ILHDNJDD